      "writtenOn": "2026-07-29T09:16:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "question: I\u0027m confused, are some parts of the extended attribute ignored depending on the key used ? If you use \"access\", are \"u::rw-\", \"g::r-x\" and \"o\" ignored ? And the contrary for default acl ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 64,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 70,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "b2fa724acc8755709cb4942acb8a1a9e58c65f24",
